== Overview ==
This template is designed to generate links to a wide variety of music streaming services and online music shops. It supports different platforms based on user input and displays an icon (with a link to the respective item) for the specified website.

== Parameters ==
{| class="wikitable"
! No. !! Parameter !! Description
|-
| '''1'''||'''Platform Name''' (mandatory) || The name of the website/platform for which you want to generate the link. Example: ''amazon'', ''itunes'', ''spotify'', etc.
|-
| '''2'''||'''Item/Album ID''' (mandatory) || The unique identifier of the item (e.g., album ID or product ID). This ID is used in the URL to direct users to the correct page.
|-
| '''3'''||'''Store Name for booth.pm or Link Description for platform other than booth.pm''' (optional) || If applicable, the name of the store or artist when using platforms like Booth. If this parameter is not required for the chosen platform, it can be served as description field or left empty.
|-
| '''4'''||'''Description for Booth.pm''' (optional) || The description of the link for Booth.pm. It can be left empty.
|}

