== Usage Examples ==
Here are a few examples showing how to use the template for different platforms:
<pre>
 <table>
  <tr>
    <td>{{LType2|amazon|amazonid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|booth|2592696|relu|Limited Edition CD}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|amazonmusic|amazonmusicalbumid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|amazonmusicjp|amazonmusicalbumid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|spotify|spotifyalbumid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|spotify-track|spotifytrackid|Regular Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|yt|ytvideoid|MV}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|animate-intl|productid|description}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|universal|tyct39095}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|sony|LGIN000001012}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|amatsuki|ラスト-フレグランス-通常盤-初回プレス}}</td>
  </tr>
 </table>
</pre>
...results in:
<table>
<tr>
    <td>{{LType2|amazon|amazonid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|booth|2592696|relu|Limited Edition CD}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|amazonmusic|amazonmusicalbumid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|amazonmusicjp|amazonmusicalbumid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|spotify|spotifyalbumid|Limited Edition}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|spotify-track|spotifytrackid|Regular Edition}}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
    <td>{{LType2|yt|ytvideoid|MV}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|animate-intl|productid|description}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|universal|tyct39095}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|sony|LGIN000001012}}</td>
    <td>{{LType2|amatsuki|ラスト-フレグランス-通常盤-初回プレス}}</td>
</tr>
</table>
<small style='color:red'>
For booth link, for example, if the link is https://relu.booth.pm/items/2592696, the format is: <pre>{{LType2|booth|2592696|relu|Limited Edition CD}}</pre>
<ol>
<li>The zeroth index will always be the 'LType2' template.</li>
<li>The first index is 'booth'.</li>
<li>The second index is the product ID, in this case, '2592696'.</li>
<li>The third index is the subdomain of the booth, here it is 'relu'.</li>
<li>The forth index is the description of the booth product, here it is 'Limited Edition CD'.</li>
</ol>
</small>

